<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT BANGLADESH BY 103 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT BANGLADESH BY 103 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Bangladesh by 103 runs in their Asia Cup match at the Singhalese Sports Club ground on Tuesday. The game was reduced from 50 to 46 overs after overnight rain.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 296-4 (46 overs), Bangladesh 193-8 (46).</p>
</text>
